  "bio": "Kyle of Steadfast Tattoo Co., based in Northwest Arkansas, is a tattoo artist of exceptional skill whose mastery in neotraditional, traditional, and newschool styles ensures each client leaves with a piece of art that exceeds expectations. Known for maintaining an immaculate workspace, cleanliness is a top priority, providing clients with a safe and hygienic environment for their ink. Reach out to Kyle at kptattooing@gmail.com to discuss your vision or stop by the Parker studio to witness his professionalism firsthand. Thank you for considering Kyle for your next tattoo – you're in excellent hands.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Parker, Colorado, United States"
